@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Provision TodoApi at startup and in tests
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "User" as user
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (UI components)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoPageComponent" as page
end box
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "Angular bootstrap" as boot
  participant "Application config" as cfg
  participant "TodoApi (abstract class token)" as token
  participant "HttpTodoApi" as http
  participant "InMemoryTodoApi" as fake
  participant "TodoStore" as store
  participant "Test setup" as test
end box
== Application startup ==
user -> boot : Open the app at /
boot -> cfg : Read providers
cfg --> boot : Zoneless change detection (L2-039)
cfg --> boot : TodoApi provided with HttpTodoApi (L2-048)
boot -> page : Create TodoPageComponent for route /
page -> store : inject() TodoStore, created on first use (L2-047)
store -> token : inject() abstract TodoApi (L2-048)
token --> store : HttpTodoApi instance
store -> store : resource({ loader: () => api.list() }) (L2-047)
store -> http : list() through the TodoApi port (L2-048)
note over store, http
  The list read uses resource with a TodoApi loader,
  not httpResource, so HttpTodoApi stays the only
  class that uses HttpClient.
end note
== Test configuration ==
test -> token : Provide InMemoryTodoApi for TodoApi (L2-048)
test -> store : inject() TodoStore
store -> token : inject() abstract TodoApi (L2-048)
token --> store : InMemoryTodoApi instance
store -> fake : Call TodoApi operations without HttpTestingController (L2-048)
fake --> store : In-memory results typed by core/api/models (L2-048)
@enduml
